[{"id":"ahabba-7-55-6","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"voli","en":"he/it loves"},{"bs":"i volite","en":"and you (all) love"},{"bs":"volite ih","en":"you (all) love them"},{"bs":"voli ih","en":"he/it loves them"}],"ref":"7:55","answerWord":"يُحِبُّ","answerSound":"audio/3ff2543b9ffeaaa3c4db.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(O mankind!) Call upon your Lord humbly and in secret. Lo! He loveth not aggressors.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["ٱدْعُوا۟","رَبَّكُمْ","تَضَرُّعًا","وَخُفْيَةً","إِنَّهُۥ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-75-20-2","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"volite","en":"you love"},{"bs":"vole ih","en":"they love them"},{"bs":"i voli","en":"and he/it loves"},{"bs":"voli ih","en":"he/it loves them"}],"ref":"75:20","answerWord":"تُحِبُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/741af5a94fef8eb881c4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but ye do love the fleeting Now","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["كَلَّا","بَلْ","تُحِبُّونَ","ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-76-27-2","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"vole","en":"they love"},{"bs":"voli vas","en":"he/it loves you (all)"},{"bs":"volite ih","en":"you (all) love them"},{"bs":"voli ih","en":"he/it loves them"}],"ref":"76:27","answerWord":"يُحِبُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/2958087e20c9dc8a2765.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! these love fleeting life, and put behind them (the remembrance of) a grievous day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["إِنَّ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","يُحِبُّونَ","ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ","وَيَذَرُونَ","وَرَآءَهُمْ","يَوْمًا","ثَقِيلًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-2-216-15","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"volite","en":"you (all) love"},{"bs":"voli vas","en":"he/it loves you (all)"},{"bs":"vole ih","en":"they love them"},{"bs":"zar voli?","en":"does he/it love?"}],"ref":"2:216","answerWord":"تُحِبُّوا۟","answerSound":"audio/22e31adcfc76b5041bec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Warfare is ordained for you, though it is hateful unto you; but it may happen that ye hate a thing which is good for you, and it may happen that ye love a thing which is bad for you. Allah knoweth, ye know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["كُتِبَ","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْقِتَالُ","وَهُوَ","كُرْهٌ","لَّكُمْ","وَعَسَىٰٓ","أَن","تَكْرَهُوا۟","شَيْـًٔا","وَهُوَ","خَيْرٌ","لَّكُمْ","وَعَسَىٰٓ","أَن","تُحِبُّوا۟","شَيْـًٔا","وَهُوَ","شَرٌّ","لَّكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","وَأَنتُمْ","لَا","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-2-222-25","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"i voli","en":"and he/it loves"},{"bs":"volim","en":"I love"},{"bs":"voli vas","en":"he/it loves you (all)"},{"bs":"volite ih","en":"you (all) love them"}],"ref":"2:222","answerWord":"وَيُحِبُّ","answerSound":"audio/51558eed747537de0746.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They question thee (O Muhammad) concerning menstruation. Say: It is an illness, so let women alone at such times and go not in unto them till they are cleansed. And when they have purified themselves, then go in unto them as Allah hath enjoined upon you. Truly Allah loveth those who turn unto Him, and loveth those who have a care for cleanness.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["وَيَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","عَنِ","ٱلْمَحِيضِ","قُلْ","هُوَ","أَذًى","فَٱعْتَزِلُوا۟","ٱلنِّسَآءَ","فِى","ٱلْمَحِيضِ","وَلَا","تَقْرَبُوهُنَّ","حَتَّىٰ","يَطْهُرْنَ","فَإِذَا","تَطَهَّرْنَ","فَأْتُوهُنَّ","مِنْ","حَيْثُ","أَمَرَكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلتَّوَّٰبِينَ","وَيُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُتَطَهِّرِينَ"],"marked":[25],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-3-31-6","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"voli vas","en":"he/it loves you (all)"},{"bs":"volite ih","en":"you (all) love them"},{"bs":"volite","en":"you (all) love"},{"bs":"vole","en":"they love"}],"ref":"3:31","answerWord":"يُحْبِبْكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/934c9d24757f6027169a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say, (O Muhammad, to mankind): If ye love Allah, follow me; Allah will love you and forgive you your sins. Allah is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تُحِبُّونَ","ٱللَّهَ","فَٱتَّبِعُونِى","يُحْبِبْكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَيَغْفِرْ","لَكُمْ","ذُنُوبَكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-3-119-2","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"volite ih","en":"you (all) love them"},{"bs":"i volite","en":"and you (all) love"},{"bs":"volite je","en":"you (all) love it"},{"bs":"voli ih","en":"he/it loves them"}],"ref":"3:119","answerWord":"تُحِبُّونَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e54bdac80f0903fd4b6f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! ye are those who love them though they love you not, and ye believe in all the Scripture. When they fall in with you they say: We believe; but when they go apart they bite their finger-tips at you, for rage. Say: Perish in your rage! Lo! Allah is Aware of what is hidden in (your) breasts.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["هَٰٓأَنتُمْ","أُو۟لَآءِ","تُحِبُّونَهُمْ","وَلَا","يُحِبُّونَكُمْ","وَتُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱلْكِتَٰبِ","كُلِّهِۦ","وَإِذَا","لَقُوكُمْ","قَالُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","وَإِذَا","خَلَوْا۟","عَضُّوا۟","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْأَنَامِلَ","مِنَ","ٱلْغَيْظِ","قُلْ","مُوتُوا۟","بِغَيْظِكُمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِذَاتِ","ٱلصُّدُورِ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-3-119-4","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"vole vas","en":"they love you (all)"},{"bs":"volite je","en":"you (all) love it"},{"bs":"zavolio sam","en":"I loved"},{"bs":"volim","en":"I love"}],"ref":"3:119","answerWord":"يُحِبُّونَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/dad8c8576909be42b639.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! ye are those who love them though they love you not, and ye believe in all the Scripture. When they fall in with you they say: We believe; but when they go apart they bite their finger-tips at you, for rage. Say: Perish in your rage! Lo! Allah is Aware of what is hidden in (your) breasts.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["هَٰٓأَنتُمْ","أُو۟لَآءِ","تُحِبُّونَهُمْ","وَلَا","يُحِبُّونَكُمْ","وَتُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱلْكِتَٰبِ","كُلِّهِۦ","وَإِذَا","لَقُوكُمْ","قَالُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","وَإِذَا","خَلَوْا۟","عَضُّوا۟","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْأَنَامِلَ","مِنَ","ٱلْغَيْظِ","قُلْ","مُوتُوا۟","بِغَيْظِكُمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِذَاتِ","ٱلصُّدُورِ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-3-188-6","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"i vole","en":"and they love"},{"bs":"voli ih","en":"he/it loves them"},{"bs":"i vole ga","en":"and they love him"},{"bs":"volim","en":"I love"}],"ref":"3:188","answerWord":"وَّيُحِبُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/ea45fafbdff8870e4f67.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Think not that those who exult in what they have given, and love to be praised for what they have not done - Think not, they are in safety from the doom. A painful doom is theirs.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["لَا","تَحْسَبَنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَفْرَحُونَ","بِمَآ","أَتَوا۟","وَّيُحِبُّونَ","أَن","يُحْمَدُوا۟","بِمَا","لَمْ","يَفْعَلُوا۟","فَلَا","تَحْسَبَنَّهُم","بِمَفَازَةٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-6-76-13","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"volim","en":"I love"},{"bs":"zavolio sam","en":"I loved"},{"bs":"voli vas","en":"he/it loves you (all)"},{"bs":"i vole","en":"and they love"}],"ref":"6:76","answerWord":"أُحِبُّ","answerSound":"audio/c85de370b0286198d64c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When the night grew dark upon him he beheld a star. He said: This is my Lord. But when it set, he said: I love not things that set.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","جَنَّ","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلَّيْلُ","رَءَا","كَوْكَبًا","قَالَ","هَٰذَا","رَبِّى","فَلَمَّآ","أَفَلَ","قَالَ","لَآ","أُحِبُّ","ٱلْءَافِلِينَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-28-56-4","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"volio si","en":"you loved"},{"bs":"vole","en":"they love"},{"bs":"voli ih","en":"he/it loves them"},{"bs":"volim","en":"I love"}],"ref":"28:56","answerWord":"أَحْبَبْتَ","answerSound":"audio/4e4aed970ab65e0e2b07.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! thou (O Muhammad) guidest not whom thou lovest, but Allah guideth whom He will. And He is Best Aware of those who walk aright.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["إِنَّكَ","لَا","تَهْدِى","مَنْ","أَحْبَبْتَ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يَهْدِى","مَن","يَشَآءُ","وَهُوَ","أَعْلَمُ","بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-38-32-2","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"zavolio sam","en":"I loved"},{"bs":"voli ih","en":"he/it loves them"},{"bs":"zar voli?","en":"does he/it love?"},{"bs":"i volite","en":"and you (all) love"}],"ref":"38:32","answerWord":"أَحْبَبْتُ","answerSound":"audio/51e4a47a57d0db0da39e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And he said: Lo! I have preferred the good things (of the world) to the remembrance of my Lord; till they were taken out of sight behind the curtain.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["فَقَالَ","إِنِّىٓ","أَحْبَبْتُ","حُبَّ","ٱلْخَيْرِ","عَن","ذِكْرِ","رَبِّى","حَتَّىٰ","تَوَارَتْ","بِٱلْحِجَابِ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-61-13-1","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"volite je","en":"you (all) love it"},{"bs":"vole ih","en":"they love them"},{"bs":"i vole ga","en":"and they love him"},{"bs":"volio si","en":"you loved"}],"ref":"61:13","answerWord":"تُحِبُّونَهَا","answerSound":"audio/23cbcf008b4ce61da50c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (He will give you) another (blessing) which ye love: help from Allah and present victory. Give good tidings (O Muhammad) to believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["وَأُخْرَىٰ","تُحِبُّونَهَا","نَصْرٌ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَفَتْحٌ","قَرِيبٌ","وَبَشِّرِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"ahabba-89-20-0","words":["verb:ahabba"],"options":[{"bs":"i volite","en":"and you (all) love"},{"bs":"volite ih","en":"you (all) love them"},{"bs":"vole ih","en":"they love them"},{"bs":"volim","en":"I love"}],"ref":"89:20","answerWord":"وَتُحِبُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/daa1dd8a756f602a9593.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And love wealth with abounding love.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"voljeti","en":"to love"},"passage":["وَتُحِبُّونَ","ٱلْمَالَ","حُبًّا","جَمًّا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَبَّ"}},{"id":"massa-3-140-4","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknuo je","en":"he/it touched"},{"bs":"dotaknula ih je","en":"she/it touched them"},{"bs":"dotiče me","en":"he/it touches me"},{"bs":"zaista će dotaknuti","en":"surely he/it will touch"}],"ref":"3:140","answerWord":"مَسَّ","answerSound":"audio/8d70100c9762915d5d26.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If ye have received a blow, the (disbelieving) people have received a blow the like thereof. These are (only) the vicissitudes which We cause to follow one another for mankind, to the end that Allah may know those who believe and may choose witnesses from among you; and Allah loveth not wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["إِن","يَمْسَسْكُمْ","قَرْحٌ","فَقَدْ","مَسَّ","ٱلْقَوْمَ","قَرْحٌ","مِّثْلُهُۥ","وَتِلْكَ","ٱلْأَيَّامُ","نُدَاوِلُهَا","بَيْنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","وَلِيَعْلَمَ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَيَتَّخِذَ","مِنكُمْ","شُهَدَآءَ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-70-20-1","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"(kad ga) zadesi (zlo)","en":"(when evil) touches him"},{"bs":"dotaknula ih je","en":"she/it touched them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo nas je","en":"he/it touched us"},{"bs":"dotaknuo je","en":"he/it touched"}],"ref":"70:20","answerWord":"مَسَّهُ","answerSound":"audio/c230f3a304baee74fcda.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Fretful when evil befalleth him","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["إِذَا","مَسَّهُ","ٱلشَّرُّ","جَزُوعًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-6-17-1","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotiče te","en":"he/it touches you"},{"bs":"dotaknuo vas je","en":"he/it touched you (all)"},{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo me je","en":"he/it touched me"}],"ref":"6:17","answerWord":"يَمْسَسْكَ","answerSound":"audio/816c730e8583268c4f85.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If Allah touch thee with affliction, there is none that can relieve therefrom save Him, and if He touch thee with good fortune (there is none that can impair it); for He is Able to do all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["وَإِن","يَمْسَسْكَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِضُرٍّ","فَلَا","كَاشِفَ","لَهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","هُوَ","وَإِن","يَمْسَسْكَ","بِخَيْرٍ","فَهُوَ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرٌ"],"marked":[1,10],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-26-156-1","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotičete je","en":"you (all) touch her"},{"bs":"dotiče nas","en":"he/it touches us"},{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo ih je","en":"he/it touched them"}],"ref":"26:156","answerWord":"تَمَسُّوهَا","answerSound":"audio/93f8149eb743f97db4b9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And touch her not with ill lest there come on you the retribution of an awful day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَمَسُّوهَا","بِسُوٓءٍ","فَيَأْخُذَكُمْ","عَذَابُ","يَوْمٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-7-188-19","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknuo me je","en":"he/it touched me"},{"bs":"dotaknula ih je","en":"she/it touched them"},{"bs":"dotiče vas","en":"he/it touches you (all)"},{"bs":"dotaknuo ih je","en":"he/it touched them"}],"ref":"7:188","answerWord":"مَسَّنِىَ","answerSound":"audio/3ecdafa3c8eacb68600d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: For myself I have no power to benefit, nor power to hurt, save that which Allah willeth. Had I knowledge of the Unseen, I should have abundance of wealth, and adversity would not touch me. I am but a warner, and a bearer of good tidings unto folk who believe.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["قُل","لَّآ","أَمْلِكُ","لِنَفْسِى","نَفْعًا","وَلَا","ضَرًّا","إِلَّا","مَا","شَآءَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَلَوْ","كُنتُ","أَعْلَمُ","ٱلْغَيْبَ","لَٱسْتَكْثَرْتُ","مِنَ","ٱلْخَيْرِ","وَمَا","مَسَّنِىَ","ٱلسُّوٓءُ","إِنْ","أَنَا۠","إِلَّا","نَذِيرٌ","وَبَشِيرٌ","لِّقَوْمٍ","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-3-47-7","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotiče me","en":"he/it touches me"},{"bs":"dotičete je","en":"you (all) touch her"},{"bs":"dotaknuo vas je","en":"he/it touched you (all)"},{"bs":"(kad ga) zadesi (zlo)","en":"(when evil) touches him"}],"ref":"3:47","answerWord":"يَمْسَسْنِى","answerSound":"audio/a8715e7a7eeed06a33e6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"She said: My Lord! How can I have a child when no mortal hath touched me? He said: So (it will be). Allah createth what He will. If He decreeth a thing, He saith unto it only: Be! and it is.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["قَالَتْ","رَبِّ","أَنَّىٰ","يَكُونُ","لِى","وَلَدٌ","وَلَمْ","يَمْسَسْنِى","بَشَرٌ","قَالَ","كَذَٰلِكِ","ٱللَّهُ","يَخْلُقُ","مَا","يَشَآءُ","إِذَا","قَضَىٰٓ","أَمْرًا","فَإِنَّمَا","يَقُولُ","لَهُۥ","كُن","فَيَكُونُ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-6-49-3","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"(kad ga) zadesi (zlo)","en":"(when evil) touches him"},{"bs":"dotaknula ih je","en":"she/it touched them"},{"bs":"dotiče te","en":"he/it touches you"}],"ref":"6:49","answerWord":"يَمَسُّهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/eedaa556801c8a969e90.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But as for those who deny Our revelations, torment will afflict them for that they used to disobey.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا","يَمَسُّهُمُ","ٱلْعَذَابُ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْسُقُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-11-10-5","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknula ga je","en":"she/it touched him"},{"bs":"dotaknula ih je","en":"she/it touched them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo ga je","en":"he/it touched him"},{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"}],"ref":"11:10","answerWord":"مَسَّتْهُ","answerSound":"audio/8fd1e57035be9fe119b4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if We cause him to taste grace after some misfortune that had befallen him, he saith: The ills have gone from me. Lo! he is exultant, boastful;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["وَلَئِنْ","أَذَقْنَٰهُ","نَعْمَآءَ","بَعْدَ","ضَرَّآءَ","مَسَّتْهُ","لَيَقُولَنَّ","ذَهَبَ","ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتُ","عَنِّىٓ","إِنَّهُۥ","لَفَرِحٌ","فَخُورٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-12-88-6","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknuo nas je","en":"he/it touched us"},{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"dotiče vas","en":"he/it touches you (all)"},{"bs":"dotiče me","en":"he/it touches me"}],"ref":"12:88","answerWord":"مَسَّنَا","answerSound":"audio/b70c502ca564396f09f3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they came (again) before him (Joseph) they said: O ruler! Misfortune hath touched us and our folk, and we bring but poor merchandise, so fill for us the measure and be charitable unto us. Lo! Allah will requite the charitable,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","دَخَلُوا۟","عَلَيْهِ","قَالُوا۟","يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلْعَزِيزُ","مَسَّنَا","وَأَهْلَنَا","ٱلضُّرُّ","وَجِئْنَا","بِبِضَٰعَةٍ","مُّزْجَىٰةٍ","فَأَوْفِ","لَنَا","ٱلْكَيْلَ","وَتَصَدَّقْ","عَلَيْنَآ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يَجْزِى","ٱلْمُتَصَدِّقِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-16-53-8","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknuo vas je","en":"he/it touched you (all)"},{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo ga je","en":"he/it touched him"},{"bs":"dotiče nas","en":"he/it touches us"}],"ref":"16:53","answerWord":"مَسَّكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/f147250843216e7a8eca.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whatever of comfort ye enjoy, it is from Allah. Then, when misfortune reacheth you, unto Him ye cry for help.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["وَمَا","بِكُم","مِّن","نِّعْمَةٍ","فَمِنَ","ٱللَّهِ","ثُمَّ","إِذَا","مَسَّكُمُ","ٱلضُّرُّ","فَإِلَيْهِ","تَجْـَٔرُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-35-35-7","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotiče nas","en":"he/it touches us"},{"bs":"dotaknula ih je","en":"she/it touched them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo vas je","en":"he/it touched you (all)"},{"bs":"dotaknuo me je","en":"he/it touched me"}],"ref":"35:35","answerWord":"يَمَسُّنَا","answerSound":"audio/99d5acb7e2a6333404a6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who, of His grace, hath installed us in the mansion of eternity, where toil toucheth us not nor can weariness affect us.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَحَلَّنَا","دَارَ","ٱلْمُقَامَةِ","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦ","لَا","يَمَسُّنَا","فِيهَا","نَصَبٌ","وَلَا","يَمَسُّنَا","فِيهَا","لُغُوبٌ"],"marked":[7,11],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-2-214-12","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknula ih je","en":"she/it touched them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo ga je","en":"he/it touched him"},{"bs":"dotaknula ga je","en":"she/it touched him"},{"bs":"dotaknuo vas je","en":"he/it touched you (all)"}],"ref":"2:214","answerWord":"مَّسَّتْهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/26cafabf2852aa72eacd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or think ye that ye will enter paradise while yet there hath not come unto you the like of (that which came to) those who passed away before you? Affliction and adversity befell them, they were shaken as with earthquake, till the messenger (of Allah) and those who believed along with him said: When cometh Allah's help? Now surely Allah's help is nigh.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["أَمْ","حَسِبْتُمْ","أَن","تَدْخُلُوا۟","ٱلْجَنَّةَ","وَلَمَّا","يَأْتِكُم","مَّثَلُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","خَلَوْا۟","مِن","قَبْلِكُم","مَّسَّتْهُمُ","ٱلْبَأْسَآءُ","وَٱلضَّرَّآءُ","وَزُلْزِلُوا۟","حَتَّىٰ","يَقُولَ","ٱلرَّسُولُ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","مَعَهُۥ","مَتَىٰ","نَصْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","أَلَآ","إِنَّ","نَصْرَ","ٱللَّهِ","قَرِيبٌ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-3-140-1","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotiče vas","en":"he/it touches you (all)"},{"bs":"dotaknula ga je","en":"she/it touched him"},{"bs":"(kad ga) zadesi (zlo)","en":"(when evil) touches him"},{"bs":"dotaknuo vas je","en":"he/it touched you (all)"}],"ref":"3:140","answerWord":"يَمْسَسْكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e2f5da517fd4cd8def9e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If ye have received a blow, the (disbelieving) people have received a blow the like thereof. These are (only) the vicissitudes which We cause to follow one another for mankind, to the end that Allah may know those who believe and may choose witnesses from among you; and Allah loveth not wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["إِن","يَمْسَسْكُمْ","قَرْحٌ","فَقَدْ","مَسَّ","ٱلْقَوْمَ","قَرْحٌ","مِّثْلُهُۥ","وَتِلْكَ","ٱلْأَيَّامُ","نُدَاوِلُهَا","بَيْنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","وَلِيَعْلَمَ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَيَتَّخِذَ","مِنكُمْ","شُهَدَآءَ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-3-174-6","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"dotiče me","en":"he/it touches me"},{"bs":"dotiče vas","en":"he/it touches you (all)"},{"bs":"(kad ga) zadesi (zlo)","en":"(when evil) touches him"}],"ref":"3:174","answerWord":"يَمْسَسْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/64683b3d17c5a6eaca73.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So they returned with grace and favour from Allah, and no harm touched them. They followed the good pleasure of Allah, and Allah is of Infinite Bounty.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["فَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","بِنِعْمَةٍ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَفَضْلٍ","لَّمْ","يَمْسَسْهُمْ","سُوٓءٌ","وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟","رِضْوَٰنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","ذُو","فَضْلٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-5-73-19","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista će dotaknuti","en":"surely he/it will touch"},{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo vas je","en":"he/it touched you (all)"},{"bs":"dotaknuo me je","en":"he/it touched me"}],"ref":"5:73","answerWord":"لَيَمَسَّنَّ","answerSound":"audio/1ca106a02e5c6feab1bb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They surely disbelieve who say: Lo! Allah is the third of three; when there is no Allah save the One Allah. If they desist not from so saying a painful doom will fall on those of them who disbelieve.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["لَّقَدْ","كَفَرَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ثَالِثُ","ثَلَٰثَةٍ","وَمَا","مِنْ","إِلَٰهٍ","إِلَّآ","إِلَٰهٌ","وَٰحِدٌ","وَإِن","لَّمْ","يَنتَهُوا۟","عَمَّا","يَقُولُونَ","لَيَمَسَّنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","مِنْهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-7-201-4","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknuo ih je","en":"he/it touched them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo vas je","en":"he/it touched you (all)"},{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo je","en":"he/it touched"}],"ref":"7:201","answerWord":"مَسَّهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/c0ade3a268c63f044e9a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who ward off (evil), when a glamour from the devil troubleth them, they do but remember (Allah's Guidance) and behold them seers!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّقَوْا۟","إِذَا","مَسَّهُمْ","طَٰٓئِفٌ","مِّنَ","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنِ","تَذَكَّرُوا۟","فَإِذَا","هُم","مُّبْصِرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-10-12-20","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknuo ga je","en":"he/it touched him"},{"bs":"dotičete je","en":"you (all) touch her"},{"bs":"dotaknuo je","en":"he/it touched"},{"bs":"zaista će dotaknuti","en":"surely he/it will touch"}],"ref":"10:12","answerWord":"مَّسَّهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/749a5c9f6745d23ebbd8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if misfortune touch a man he crieth unto Us, (while reclining) on his side, or sitting or standing, but when We have relieved him of the misfortune he goeth his way as though he had not cried unto Us because of a misfortune that afflicted him. Thus is what they do made (seeming) fair unto the prodigal.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","مَسَّ","ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ","ٱلضُّرُّ","دَعَانَا","لِجَنۢبِهِۦٓ","أَوْ","قَاعِدًا","أَوْ","قَآئِمًا","فَلَمَّا","كَشَفْنَا","عَنْهُ","ضُرَّهُۥ","مَرَّ","كَأَن","لَّمْ","يَدْعُنَآ","إِلَىٰ","ضُرٍّ","مَّسَّهُۥ","كَذَٰلِكَ","زُيِّنَ","لِلْمُسْرِفِينَ","مَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-10-21-7","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotaknula ih je","en":"she/it touched them"},{"bs":"(kad ga) zadesi (zlo)","en":"(when evil) touches him"},{"bs":"dotaknuo nas je","en":"he/it touched us"},{"bs":"dotaknuo ih je","en":"he/it touched them"}],"ref":"10:21","answerWord":"مَسَّتْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/472cb97abcc066b56cb2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We cause mankind to taste of mercy after some adversity which had afflicted them, behold! they have some plot against Our revelations. Say: Allah is more swift in plotting. Lo! Our messengers write down that which ye plot.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["وَإِذَآ","أَذَقْنَا","ٱلنَّاسَ","رَحْمَةً","مِّنۢ","بَعْدِ","ضَرَّآءَ","مَسَّتْهُمْ","إِذَا","لَهُم","مَّكْرٌ","فِىٓ","ءَايَاتِنَا","قُلِ","ٱللَّهُ","أَسْرَعُ","مَكْرًا","إِنَّ","رُسُلَنَا","يَكْتُبُونَ","مَا","تَمْكُرُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-11-48-14","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"dotaknuo ga je","en":"he/it touched him"},{"bs":"zaista će dotaknuti","en":"surely he/it will touch"},{"bs":"dotiče nas","en":"he/it touches us"}],"ref":"11:48","answerWord":"يَمَسُّهُم","answerSound":"audio/04f7abf7a7f17e9e1353.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It was said (unto him): O Noah! Go thou down (from the mountain) with peace from Us and blessings upon thee and some nations (that will spring) from those with thee. (There will be other) nations unto whom We shall give enjoyment a long while and then a painful doom from Us will overtake them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["قِيلَ","يَٰنُوحُ","ٱهْبِطْ","بِسَلَٰمٍ","مِّنَّا","وَبَرَكَٰتٍ","عَلَيْكَ","وَعَلَىٰٓ","أُمَمٍ","مِّمَّن","مَّعَكَ","وَأُمَمٌ","سَنُمَتِّعُهُمْ","ثُمَّ","يَمَسُّهُم","مِّنَّا","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"massa-15-48-1","words":["verb:massa"],"options":[{"bs":"dotiče ih","en":"he/it touches them"},{"bs":"(kad ga) zadesi (zlo)","en":"(when evil) touches him"},{"bs":"zaista će dotaknuti","en":"surely he/it will touch"},{"bs":"dotaknuo me je","en":"he/it touched me"}],"ref":"15:48","answerWord":"يَمَسُّهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/f80618c74024f9a9d5dd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Toil cometh not unto them there, nor will they be expelled from thence.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dotaknuti, zadesiti","en":"to touch"},"passage":["لَا","يَمَسُّهُمْ","فِيهَا","نَصَبٌ","وَمَا","هُم","مِّنْهَا","بِمُخْرَجِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"مَسَّ"}},{"id":"faddala-6-86-5","words":["verb:faddala"],"options":[{"bs":"odlikovali smo","en":"We favoured"},{"bs":"dao je prednost","en":"he/it preferred"},{"bs":"i dajemo prednost","en":"and we prefer"},{"bs":"dao nam je prednost","en":"he/it preferred us"}],"ref":"6:86","answerWord":"فَضَّلْنَا","answerSound":"audio/99c909c6e80d327056ce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Ishmael and Elisha and Jonah and Lot. Each one (of them) did We prefer above (Our) creatures,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlikovati, dati prednost","en":"to prefer, to favour"},"passage":["وَإِسْمَٰعِيلَ","وَٱلْيَسَعَ","وَيُونُسَ","وَلُوطًا","وَكُلًّا","فَضَّلْنَا","عَلَى","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"فَضَّلَ"}},{"id":"faddala-4-32-3","words":["verb:faddala"],"options":[{"bs":"dao je prednost","en":"he/it preferred"},{"bs":"i dajemo prednost","en":"and we prefer"},{"bs":"dao sam vam prednost","en":"I preferred you (all)"},{"bs":"dao vam je prednost","en":"he/it preferred you (all)"}],"ref":"4:32","answerWord":"فَضَّلَ","answerSound":"audio/d5eb2f1be35ab5c841be.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And covet not the thing in which Allah hath made some of you excel others. Unto men a fortune from that which they have earned, and unto women a fortune from that which they have earned. (Envy not one another) but ask Allah of His bounty. Lo! Allah is ever Knower of all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlikovati, dati prednost","en":"to prefer, to favour"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَتَمَنَّوْا۟","مَا","فَضَّلَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِهِۦ","بَعْضَكُمْ","عَلَىٰ","بَعْضٍ","لِّلرِّجَالِ","نَصِيبٌ","مِّمَّا","ٱكْتَسَبُوا۟","وَلِلنِّسَآءِ","نَصِيبٌ","مِّمَّا","ٱكْتَسَبْنَ","وَسْـَٔلُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦٓ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","بِكُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","عَلِيمًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"فَضَّلَ"}},{"id":"faddala-2-47-8","words":["verb:faddala"],"options":[{"bs":"dao sam vam prednost","en":"I preferred you (all)"},{"bs":"odlikovali smo","en":"We favoured"},{"bs":"dao je prednost","en":"he/it preferred"},{"bs":"dao vam je prednost","en":"he/it preferred you (all)"}],"ref":"2:47","answerWord":"فَضَّلْتُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/d6b2e942c834abb43ff2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O Children of Israel! Remember My favour wherewith I favoured you and how I preferred you to (all) creatures.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlikovati, dati prednost","en":"to prefer, to favour"},"passage":["يَٰبَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","ٱذْكُرُوا۟","نِعْمَتِىَ","ٱلَّتِىٓ","أَنْعَمْتُ","عَلَيْكُمْ","وَأَنِّى","فَضَّلْتُكُمْ","عَلَى","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"فَضَّلَ"}},{"id":"faddala-17-70-11","words":["verb:faddala"],"options":[{"bs":"i dali smo im prednost","en":"and we preferred them"},{"bs":"dao je prednost","en":"he/it preferred"},{"bs":"dao sam vam prednost","en":"I preferred you (all)"},{"bs":"dao vam je prednost","en":"he/it preferred you (all)"}],"ref":"17:70","answerWord":"وَفَضَّلْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/d9cfb417b7c2f5a97242.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Verily we have honoured the Children of Adam. We carry them on the land and the sea, and have made provision of good things for them, and have preferred them above many of those whom We created with a marked preferment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlikovati, dati prednost","en":"to prefer, to favour"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","كَرَّمْنَا","بَنِىٓ","ءَادَمَ","وَحَمَلْنَٰهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْبَرِّ","وَٱلْبَحْرِ","وَرَزَقْنَٰهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلطَّيِّبَٰتِ","وَفَضَّلْنَٰهُمْ","عَلَىٰ","كَثِيرٍ","مِّمَّنْ","خَلَقْنَا","تَفْضِيلًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"فَضَّلَ"}},{"id":"faddala-7-140-6","words":["verb:faddala"],"options":[{"bs":"dao vam je prednost","en":"he/it preferred you (all)"},{"bs":"dao sam vam prednost","en":"I preferred you (all)"},{"bs":"odlikovani su","en":"they were preferred"},{"bs":"i dao je prednost","en":"and he/it preferred"}],"ref":"7:140","answerWord":"فَضَّلَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/06bf246e70a31796ac7f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Shall I seek for you a god other than Allah when He hath favoured you above (all) creatures?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlikovati, dati prednost","en":"to prefer, to favour"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَغَيْرَ","ٱللَّهِ","أَبْغِيكُمْ","إِلَٰهًا","وَهُوَ","فَضَّلَكُمْ","عَلَى","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"فَضَّلَ"}},{"id":"faddala-13-4-15","words":["verb:faddala"],"options":[{"bs":"i dajemo prednost","en":"and we prefer"},{"bs":"odlikovali smo","en":"We favoured"},{"bs":"odlikovani su","en":"they were preferred"},{"bs":"i dali smo im prednost","en":"and we preferred them"}],"ref":"13:4","answerWord":"وَنُفَضِّلُ","answerSound":"audio/8509481306cf5abfedec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And in the Earth are neighbouring tracts, vineyards and ploughed lands, and date-palms, like and unlike, which are watered with one water. And we have made some of them to excel others in fruit. Lo! herein verily are portents for people who have sense.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlikovati, dati prednost","en":"to prefer, to favour"},"passage":["وَفِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","قِطَعٌ","مُّتَجَٰوِرَٰتٌ","وَجَنَّٰتٌ","مِّنْ","أَعْنَٰبٍ","وَزَرْعٌ","وَنَخِيلٌ","صِنْوَانٌ","وَغَيْرُ","صِنْوَانٍ","يُسْقَىٰ","بِمَآءٍ","وَٰحِدٍ","وَنُفَضِّلُ","بَعْضَهَا","عَلَىٰ","بَعْضٍ","فِى","ٱلْأُكُلِ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَءَايَٰتٍ","لِّقَوْمٍ","يَعْقِلُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"فَضَّلَ"}},{"id":"faddala-16-71-9","words":["verb:faddala"],"options":[{"bs":"odlikovani su","en":"they were preferred"},{"bs":"dao je prednost","en":"he/it preferred"},{"bs":"odlikovali smo","en":"We favoured"},{"bs":"i dali smo im prednost","en":"and we preferred them"}],"ref":"16:71","answerWord":"فُضِّلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/6c50594501a5730b96bd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Allah hath favoured some of you above others in provision. Now those who are more favoured will by no means hand over their provision to those (slaves) whom their right hands possess, so that they may be equal with them in respect thereof. Is it then the grace of Allah that they deny?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlikovati, dati prednost","en":"to prefer, to favour"},"passage":["وَٱللَّهُ","فَضَّلَ","بَعْضَكُمْ","عَلَىٰ","بَعْضٍ","فِى","ٱلرِّزْقِ","فَمَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","فُضِّلُوا۟","بِرَآدِّى","رِزْقِهِمْ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","مَلَكَتْ","أَيْمَٰنُهُمْ","فَهُمْ","فِيهِ","سَوَآءٌ","أَفَبِنِعْمَةِ","ٱللَّهِ","يَجْحَدُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"فَضَّلَ"}},{"id":"faddala-27-15-9","words":["verb:faddala"],"options":[{"bs":"dao nam je prednost","en":"he/it preferred us"},{"bs":"i dao je prednost","en":"and he/it preferred"},{"bs":"odlikovani su","en":"they were preferred"},{"bs":"odlikovali smo","en":"We favoured"}],"ref":"27:15","answerWord":"فَضَّلَنَا","answerSound":"audio/43ee05b76b28952b59af.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We verily gave knowledge unto David and Solomon, and they said: Praise be to Allah, Who hath preferred us above many of His believing slaves!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlikovati, dati prednost","en":"to prefer, to favour"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","ءَاتَيْنَا","دَاوُۥدَ","وَسُلَيْمَٰنَ","عِلْمًا","وَقَالَا","ٱلْحَمْدُ","لِلَّهِ","ٱلَّذِى","فَضَّلَنَا","عَلَىٰ","كَثِيرٍ","مِّنْ","عِبَادِهِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"فَضَّلَ"}},{"id":"kabura-61-3-0","words":["verb:kabura"],"options":[{"bs":"veliko je","en":"it is grievous"},{"bs":"bila je teška","en":"she/it was grievous"},{"bs":"težak je","en":"he/it is grievous"},{"bs":"odrastaju","en":"they grow up"}],"ref":"61:3","answerWord":"كَبُرَ","answerSound":"audio/7e9b60819f56d7aa4f9d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is most hateful in the sight of Allah that ye say that which ye do not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrasti, postati velik","en":"to grow up, to become great"},"passage":["كَبُرَ","مَقْتًا","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","أَن","تَقُولُوا۟","مَا","لَا","تَفْعَلُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"كَبُرَ"}},{"id":"kabura-17-51-3","words":["verb:kabura"],"options":[{"bs":"težak je","en":"he/it is grievous"},{"bs":"bila je teška","en":"she/it was grievous"},{"bs":"veliko je","en":"it is grievous"},{"bs":"odrastaju","en":"they grow up"}],"ref":"17:51","answerWord":"يَكْبُرُ","answerSound":"audio/d3db6cee005fc0ef55bb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or some created thing that is yet greater in your thoughts! Then they will say: Who shall bring us back (to life). Say: He Who created you at the first. Then will they shake their heads at thee, and say: When will it be? Say: It will perhaps be soon;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrasti, postati velik","en":"to grow up, to become great"},"passage":["أَوْ","خَلْقًا","مِّمَّا","يَكْبُرُ","فِى","صُدُورِكُمْ","فَسَيَقُولُونَ","مَن","يُعِيدُنَا","قُلِ","ٱلَّذِى","فَطَرَكُمْ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","فَسَيُنْغِضُونَ","إِلَيْكَ","رُءُوسَهُمْ","وَيَقُولُونَ","مَتَىٰ","هُوَ","قُلْ","عَسَىٰٓ","أَن","يَكُونَ","قَرِيبًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"كَبُرَ"}},{"id":"kabura-18-5-7","words":["verb:kabura"],"options":[{"bs":"bila je teška","en":"she/it was grievous"},{"bs":"težak je","en":"he/it is grievous"},{"bs":"veliko je","en":"it is grievous"},{"bs":"odrastaju","en":"they grow up"}],"ref":"18:5","answerWord":"كَبُرَتْ","answerSound":"audio/f4ccb0f8b469af774416.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(A thing) whereof they have no knowledge, nor (had) their fathers, Dreadful is the word that cometh out of their mouths. They speak naught but a lie.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrasti, postati velik","en":"to grow up, to become great"},"passage":["مَّا","لَهُم","بِهِۦ","مِنْ","عِلْمٍ","وَلَا","لِءَابَآئِهِمْ","كَبُرَتْ","كَلِمَةً","تَخْرُجُ","مِنْ","أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ","إِن","يَقُولُونَ","إِلَّا","كَذِبًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"كَبُرَ"}},{"id":"qattala-7-127-14","words":["verb:qattala"],"options":[{"bs":"pobit ćemo","en":"we will slaughter"},{"bs":"ubijaju","en":"they slaughter"},{"bs":"budu pobijeni","en":"they are slaughtered"},{"bs":"i pobijeni su","en":"and they were slaughtered"}],"ref":"7:127","answerWord":"سَنُقَتِّلُ","answerSound":"audio/1476eef4f25c0618bf61.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The chiefs of Pharaoh's people said: (O King), wilt thou suffer Moses and his people to make mischief in the land, and flout thee and thy gods? He said: We will slay their sons and spare their women, for lo! we are in power over them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobiti, masovno ubijati","en":"to slaughter, to massacre"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلْمَلَأُ","مِن","قَوْمِ","فِرْعَوْنَ","أَتَذَرُ","مُوسَىٰ","وَقَوْمَهُۥ","لِيُفْسِدُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَيَذَرَكَ","وَءَالِهَتَكَ","قَالَ","سَنُقَتِّلُ","أَبْنَآءَهُمْ","وَنَسْتَحْىِۦ","نِسَآءَهُمْ","وَإِنَّا","فَوْقَهُمْ","قَٰهِرُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"قَتَّلَ"}},{"id":"qattala-33-61-4","words":["verb:qattala"],"options":[{"bs":"i pobijeni su","en":"and they were slaughtered"},{"bs":"pobit ćemo","en":"we will slaughter"},{"bs":"budu pobijeni","en":"they are slaughtered"},{"bs":"ubijaju","en":"they slaughter"}],"ref":"33:61","answerWord":"وَقُتِّلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/d8cc827788e077768a0f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Accursed, they will be seized wherever found and slain with a (fierce) slaughter.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pobiti, masovno ubijati","en":"to slaughter, to massacre"},"passage":["مَّلْعُونِينَ","أَيْنَمَا","ثُقِفُوٓا۟","أُخِذُوا۟","وَقُتِّلُوا۟","تَقْتِيلًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"قَتَّلَ"}}]